{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12326","headline":"玉山东溪题李叟屋壁 · 钱起","name":"玉山东溪题李叟屋壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霞景已斜照，烟溪方暝投。\n山家归路僻，辙迹乱泉流。\n野老采薇暇，蜗庐招客幽。\n麏麚突荒院，鸬鹊步闲畴。\n偶此惬真性，令人轻宦游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12326.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12326","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}